{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Sleepless Night", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 6, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Phrasal Verbs about Staying Healthy", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " There are many phrasal verbs that are used to talk about staying healthy.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Phrasal verbs are made up of a verb and a particle (a preposition or adverb). Some common particles such as \"on\" or \"off\", help to make verbs with new definitions.  These new meanings are often not literal. For example, <span class=\"strong\">to look up</span> means to gaze upwards (He <span class=\"strong\">looked up</span> into the sky) but to <span class=\"strong\">look up</span> also means to search for some information, usually in a book (<span class=\"italic\">I looked up the meanings of all the new words I learned in class today <span class=\"strong\">.)</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"> Phrasal Verb</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <div class=\\\"center_text\\\">Meaning and Example</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">build up</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"an increase in something, often slowly over a period of time <br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: It takes regular hard work to <span class=\\\"strong\\\">build up</span> your muscles from exercising.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">put on</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to add something such as weight or muscle <br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: I really need to go to the gym. I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">put on</span> a lot of weight last month.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">take up</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to become interested in doing a new activity<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: I'm going to <span class=\\\"strong\\\">take up</span> skiing this winter. I've never done it before, but it looks fun.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">cut out</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to stop doing something, often to improve your health<br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: I need to <span class=\\\"strong\\\">cut out smoking</span> if I want to run a marathon.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">give up</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to quit doing something, often for health purposes <br/><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Example: I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">gave up sugar</span> 2 months ago and I have so much more energy.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " \u201cIf\u201d Clauses with Modals to Give Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use modals like  <span class=\"italic\">should</span>,  <span class=\"italic\">would</span>, and  <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> to give advice. You can also use an  <span class=\"italic\">if</span> clause before the modal to describe a condition that you're giving advice for.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " <span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Simple Present + <span class=\"italic\">should</span> + <span class=\"italic\">main verb</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Simple Past + <span class=\"italic\">would</span> + <span class=\"italic\">main verb</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">If</span> + Present Continuous + <span class=\"italic\">ought to</span> + <span class=\"italic\">main verb</span><br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" should\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I think I should take up jogging or something to lose weight.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If + should \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you're so tired, you should go to bed early.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If + would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If I were you, I would go to bed early.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" If + ought to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you're working today, you ought to take a nap this afternoon.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "nap", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a short sleep during the day to get rest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you're not working today, you ought to take a nap this afternoon to rest.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about a healthy lifestyle to relieve stress.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to catch up on", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to do something you didn't do enough of before", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was sick last week, so I need to catch up on my work. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "beauty sleep", "type": "name"}, {"content": " an expression based on the belief that more sleep makes you more beautiful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wish I could catch up on my beauty sleep.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to put on (weight)", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a polite way to talk about getting heavier", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I need to do more exercise because I feel like I've put on weight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to work off", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to get rid of excess calories or weight", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have to work off the calories from my heavy meal. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "give me a break", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a casual expression to tell someone to not be so harsh on you", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Give me a break. I want to be healthy, but some fast food is fun to eat.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le06ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, discuss some advice that friends or family have given you on how to take your mind off of stress from your job or school work. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down as many pieces of advice as you can.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Do research from the Internet to find other ways to take away stress and live a healthy life.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5 more pieces of advice.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner if the advice you wrote is good and what they would suggest.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I discuss how to reduce stress.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give advice on reducing stress.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I exchange opinions on jobs and work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le06ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob06re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello, Sally.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey, Vanessa. What's up?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm just waking up. I had a late night at the restaurant. I wish I could catch up on my beauty sleep, but I have an early morning yoga class.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: If you're not working today, you ought to take a nap this afternoon."}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob06re2img06.jpg", "time": "21000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: That sounds like a very good idea. What's going on with you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I actually didn't sleep much at all last night.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Why? What happened?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm not sure. I think work was on my mind a lot, and I had a heavy meal late in the evening. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: If writing is on your mind, you should do something relaxing in the evening."}, {"image": "engenn7le06ob06re2img02.jpg", "time": "42000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Right. I think I should take up jogging or something because I feel like I've put on weight.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You'd better cut out the poutine as well.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Give me a break. I don't want to pass out while I'm running. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You won't, but you don't want to work out just to work off the calories you consume.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Fine. I'll give it up. If I cut down on the sweets, my weight should be fine."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le06ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le06ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about staying healthy.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can give advice.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you have sleepless nights occasionally? What do you do?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What advice would you give to someone who can't sleep?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " How well do you sleep at night?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " \nSally tells Vanessa about a sleepless night.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"conte